 "descriptions": {
  "J Players": "J Players is back and creating a new show. Rehearsals are every Tuesday at 1 PM; the show takes place on Sunday, May 2.",
  "Jewish Dallas Tour with DJHS": "A historical bus tour of the five Jewish neighborhoods of Dallas with staff of the Dallas Jewish Historical Society. Monday, November 9 at 10 AM. Bring a packed picnic lunch. Free.",
  "Jews in the South with Beri Schwitzer": "Southern Jewish history: origin stories and immigration, the impact of the Civil War and influential Jewish Southerners, assimilation, and civil rights. Thursdays at 1 PM.",
  "Healing Power of Positivity with The Legacy": "A courageous conversation for health, joy, and longevity with The Legacy. Friday, November 13 at 1 PM.",
  "Special Book Club & Breakfast: The Linen Queen": "The JCC Tycher Library hosts author Patricia Falvey for a breakfast brunch and discussion of her novels, sponsored by Renee Elsner with Renee Cares. Friday, November 20 at 9:30 AM. RSVP by November 13 to Sharon Cane at scane@jccdallas.org.",
  "Games Day": "Sponsored by Dallas Jewish Funerals and The Legacy. Sunday, November 15, 10 AM to 1:30 PM. Food, fun, laughter, and friendly competition for seniors 60+. Entry is free; RSVP by November 10.",
  "Thanksgiving Lunch": "Hot kosher Thanksgiving lunch: turkey and stuffing, mashed potatoes and gravy, green beans, roll, and sweet potato pie. Wednesday, November 25 at noon.",
  "Lunch": "Hot kosher meals for all ages 60+, JCC membership not required. Weekdays at noon. Suggested donation of $4.",
  "Silver Fit": "Strength training using light hand weights.",
  "Line Dancing": "Learn new and classic line dances. All levels welcome.",
  "Exercise with Ernesto": "Strong heart, strong muscles, big smiles. Chair cardio and strength at its best.",
  "Strength and Stretch": "Strength and cardio using light hand weights and resistance bands.",
  "Balance Fitness": "Improve strength and balance, and prevent falls. Now in the dance studio.",
  "Chair Yoga": "Increase flexibility and body awareness.",
  "Closed for Thanksgiving": "The J is closed Thursday, November 26 and Friday, November 27 for Thanksgiving. No senior programs or lunch."
 },
